<title>UK: UK's Rugby Group buys Dutch Europrovyl.</title>
<headline>UK's Rugby Group buys Dutch Europrovyl.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British construction firm Rugby Group Plc announced it has bought Europrovyl, a Dutch PVCu window manufacturer, for 1.7 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Rugby said it bought the company through its European Joinery Division to boost its share of the growing Dutch PVCu window market, of which it currently controls five percent.</p>
<p>Europrovyl employs 90 people and is based in the north of the Netherlands.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
